WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.680
Another Thing That Doctor Bright Is&nbsp;
Not Allowed To Do At The Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.680 --> 00:00:08.640
He is not allowed to make himself&nbsp;
the King of anywhere. Or Queen!

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:12.560
Thanks to his SCP-963 necklace, Dr.&nbsp;
Bright can steal the bodies of pretty&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:17.120
much any non-anomalous being - including&nbsp;
powerful heads of states and monarchs.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:21.680
This would definitely be a sweet gig for&nbsp;
Dr. Bright, who could kick back and enjoy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:26.000
all the benefits of royalty. The problem is,&nbsp;
the Foundation needs him to work for them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:29.680
and if ever the necklace is removed&nbsp;
from the ruler, they’ll just drop dead.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.320
So it’s best to keep Dr. Bright away from anyone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:36.240
in a position of power when he’s in&nbsp;
one of his more capricious moods.

